(5574461, 806177, 108500, '<td valign="top">Good perspective; the shadows add texture to the bricks.  A sweet moment captured in a simple and uncluttered photo.</td>', 'Good perspective; the shadows add texture to the bricks.  A sweet moment captured in a simple and uncluttered photo.', '2009-07-15 07:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574465, 806241, 108500, '<td valign="top">Lovely pale winter''s sky - the wide-open feeling of the photo is great for an African scene where the countryside stretches off to the horizon.</td>', 'Lovely pale winter''s sky - the wide-open feeling of the photo is great for an African scene where the countryside stretches off to the horizon.', '2009-07-15 07:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574467, 806178, 108500, '<td valign="top">Love the hairs hanging off the end of the bow - good use of DOF.</td>', 'Love the hairs hanging off the end of the bow - good use of DOF.', '2009-07-15 07:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574468, 806925, 108500, '<td valign="top">Perhaps shot from a lower perspective would have been more silhouette interest?</td>', 'Perhaps shot from a lower perspective would have been more silhouette interest?', '2009-07-15 07:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574470, 807024, 108500, '<td valign="top">great colours but nothing''s in focus!</td>', 'great colours but nothing''s in focus!', '2009-07-15 07:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574490, 805524, 94239, '<td valign="top">Best so far for me, great capture of expression, composition, focus. Lovely</td>', 'Best so far for me, great capture of expression, composition, focus. Lovely', '2009-07-15 07:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574500, 807150, 88523, '<td valign="top">Fun shot : )</td>', 'Fun shot : )', '2009-07-15 08:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574501, 807040, 88523, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I don''t know, I would say that is a road...  : P</td>', 'Hmmm...I don''t know, I would say that is a road...  : P', '2009-07-15 08:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574504, 806984, 88523, '<td valign="top">Wish she came out more...but I like this!</td>', 'Wish she came out more...but I like this!', '2009-07-15 08:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574506, 806988, 88523, '<td valign="top">...and some have it harder than others... nice documentary shot.</td>', '...and some have it harder than others... nice documentary shot.', '2009-07-15 08:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574507, 807058, 88523, '<td valign="top">I really like what you saw minus the car interior...at first I felt the feeling of peering out was entriguing, but in the end I feel the scene outside stands better on its own.<br/> <br/>All in all nice shot though.</td>', 'I really like what you saw minus the car interior...at first I felt the feeling of peering out was entriguing, but in the end I feel the scene outside stands better on its own. All in all nice shot though.', '2009-07-15 08:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574521, 807442, 49773, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah!</td>', 'Oh yeah!', '2009-07-15 08:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574531, 806681, 43658, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a street??</td>', 'I don''t see a street??', '2009-07-15 08:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574534, 807040, 31664, '<td valign="top">How can I be sure this is not a road, avenue, drive, lane etc.  without evidence how do I know whether to DNMC this or not :)</td>', 'How can I be sure this is not a road, avenue, drive, lane etc.  without evidence how do I know whether to DNMC this or not :)', '2009-07-15 08:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574565, 807060, 93756, '<td valign="top">The fruit is interesting, but wish you would have captured more of the character of the man. Also, if you''d waited until the bus passed, it looks like the buildings on the block might have been a better background.</td>', 'The fruit is interesting, but wish you would have captured more of the character of the man. Also, if you''d waited until the bus passed, it looks like the buildings on the block might have been a better background.', '2009-07-15 09:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574567, 807341, 93756, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rendering of the stones and textures in the buildings. I would have liked to see more of the people and life on the block for this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful rendering of the stones and textures in the buildings. I would have liked to see more of the people and life on the block for this challenge.', '2009-07-15 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574575, 807442, 93756, '<td valign="top">Good color and good capture of the car. Nice use of the lensbaby (I assume). I''m not sure if the people sitting are compelling but then I''m starting to wonder why in the world they are sitting there with their camp chairs so this is telling a story. Good job.</td>', 'Good color and good capture of the car. Nice use of the lensbaby (I assume). I''m not sure if the people sitting are compelling but then I''m starting to wonder why in the world they are sitting there with their camp chairs so this is telling a story. Good job.', '2009-07-15 09:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574582, 807406, 93756, '<td valign="top">Too far away to show the people and what they are doing. I like the light on the building to the right.</td>', 'Too far away to show the people and what they are doing. I like the light on the building to the right.', '2009-07-15 09:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574584, 805853, 93756, '<td valign="top">Would have been better to include some people in your shot. That is a classic spot to take a photo though.</td>', 'Would have been better to include some people in your shot. That is a classic spot to take a photo though.', '2009-07-15 09:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574587, 806988, 93756, '<td valign="top">Good capture but you need to darken your levels to make the colors pop more - it looks washed out.</td>', 'Good capture but you need to darken your levels to make the colors pop more - it looks washed out.', '2009-07-15 09:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574589, 806936, 93756, '<td valign="top">If only you''d included a person in your photo it would be perfect for this challenge. Neat find just not compelling without human activity.</td>', 'If only you''d included a person in your photo it would be perfect for this challenge. Neat find just not compelling without human activity.', '2009-07-15 09:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574592, 806509, 93756, '<td valign="top">Classic street photo. A little too saturated and a little too dark on the person making her blend in with the background. Nice shot overall!</td>', 'Classic street photo. A little too saturated and a little too dark on the person making her blend in with the background. Nice shot overall!', '2009-07-15 09:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574595, 807058, 93756, '<td valign="top">Next time get out of your car.</td>', 'Next time get out of your car.', '2009-07-15 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574601, 806178, 93756, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Wish there was more bright color for this to do well in this challenge but this is classic street photo and nicely done. One of my highest scores.</td>', 'Nice capture. Wish there was more bright color for this to do well in this challenge but this is classic street photo and nicely done. One of my highest scores.', '2009-07-15 09:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574603, 806143, 93756, '<td valign="top">Wow is that dangerous. Good capture and I hope you told them to move.</td>', 'Wow is that dangerous. Good capture and I hope you told them to move.', '2009-07-15 09:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574605, 807159, 93756, '<td valign="top">Funny - why do people do these things! Your white balance is a little off - looking greenish. Good photo overall.</td>', 'Funny - why do people do these things! Your white balance is a little off - looking greenish. Good photo overall.', '2009-07-15 09:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574618, 806515, 93756, '<td valign="top">Love that guy''s hat. The bit of red wall balances the photo nicely - wish there was a little more. Good job.</td>', 'Love that guy''s hat. The bit of red wall balances the photo nicely - wish there was a little more. Good job.', '2009-07-15 09:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574624, 806727, 93756, '<td valign="top">The green of the grass and leaves is the wrong color - you need to adjust levels. That said, the capture is great - these people are interesting characters!</td>', 'The green of the grass and leaves is the wrong color - you need to adjust levels. That said, the capture is great - these people are interesting characters!', '2009-07-15 09:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5574631, 807440, 93756, '<td valign="top">The yellow line and the overall scene are good and well-photographed. The man is not very interesting.</td>', 'The yellow line and the overall scene are good and well-photographed. The man is not very interesting.', '2009-07-15 09:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
