(5576294, 807230, 103601, '<td valign="top">hahaha! i''m more concerned about the pacifier than the leash, although that is also disconcerting. this leash is meant for the child to lead the way, i suppose and is less effective in the dragging style of walking a kid. anyway, this is hysterical, great photo.<br/> <br/>one negative stands out to me, though. i''m not sure how to fix it in basic, or what even causes it, but some of the edges, especially those around the mom''s cup and bottom of her pants are sort of jagged. i''m not sure if it''s an over sharpening thing, which might have just happened on its own when you resized. no real penalty, just something to look out for.</td>', 'hahaha! i''m more concerned about the pacifier than the leash, although that is also disconcerting. this leash is meant for the child to lead the way, i suppose and is less effective in the dragging style of walking a kid. anyway, this is hysterical, great photo. one negative stands out to me, though. i''m not sure how to fix it in basic, or what even causes it, but some of the edges, especially those around the mom''s cup and bottom of her pants are sort of jagged. i''m not sure if it''s an over sharpening thing, which might have just happened on its own when you resized. no real penalty, just something to look out for.', '2009-07-16 09:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576299, 806727, 103601, '<td valign="top">this is awesome, the man''s pose is perfect. you should definitely be proud of this, and you''ll get a good score from me.<br/> <br/>hthat being said, there''s a little too much noise reduction in the grass for my tastes, although i have to admit, in a photo like this i always process it in this fashion and also without smoothing and basically flip a coin. personally i''d like to see a little more detail, but that''s nit picky and a matter of opinion.</td>', 'this is awesome, the man''s pose is perfect. you should definitely be proud of this, and you''ll get a good score from me. hthat being said, there''s a little too much noise reduction in the grass for my tastes, although i have to admit, in a photo like this i always process it in this fashion and also without smoothing and basically flip a coin. personally i''d like to see a little more detail, but that''s nit picky and a matter of opinion.', '2009-07-16 09:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5576302, 806983, 5364, '<td valign="top">This would be a good subject, but your image is rather too blurry</td>', 'This would be a good subject, but your image is rather too blurry', '2009-07-16 09:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
