(5577053, 806177, 108650, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, the subjects seem a little blurry and the lighting is too harsh.  I''m guessing you were aiming for the shadows to be your main focus, so maybe try submitting this in black and white, or sepia for a merrier mood, in a different challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition, the subjects seem a little blurry and the lighting is too harsh.  I''m guessing you were aiming for the shadows to be your main focus, so maybe try submitting this in black and white, or sepia for a merrier mood, in a different challenge.', '2009-07-16 22:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577054, 807189, 108650, '<td valign="top">Very cool subjects, unfortunately this isn''t the best composition.  Next time, ask him if he wouldn''t mind you hanging around him while he worked and take as many pictures as you can.  You''re bound to end up with a nice crisp, classic, and captivating portrait.</td>', 'Very cool subjects, unfortunately this isn''t the best composition.  Next time, ask him if he wouldn''t mind you hanging around him while he worked and take as many pictures as you can.  You''re bound to end up with a nice crisp, classic, and captivating portrait.', '2009-07-16 22:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577056, 807436, 108650, '<td valign="top">This is a very crisp photo with lots of detail.  The title is very fitting, but I would prefer it with the blurry passerby cropped out.</td>', 'This is a very crisp photo with lots of detail.  The title is very fitting, but I would prefer it with the blurry passerby cropped out.', '2009-07-16 22:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577057, 807040, 108650, '<td valign="top">I love the texture, but I dislike your attitude.  Good thing we only judge picture quality.</td>', 'I love the texture, but I dislike your attitude.  Good thing we only judge picture quality.', '2009-07-16 23:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
