(5577897, 807447, 3087, '<td valign="top">Liking the warmth of the light with the long exposure and the ghosting of the train and that one guy waiting on the platform.</td>', 'Liking the warmth of the light with the long exposure and the ghosting of the train and that one guy waiting on the platform.', '2009-07-17 19:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5577898, 807172, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well, I like the flowers but all I can focus on is the lady''s backside. Unless it''s a play on words with the mooning?</td>', 'Well, I like the flowers but all I can focus on is the lady''s backside. Unless it''s a play on words with the mooning?', '2009-07-17 19:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578002, 806509, 19831, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool use of the background. :-) I wonder how long you had to wait for someone to walk by just right? :-)</td>', 'Pretty cool use of the background. :-) I wonder how long you had to wait for someone to walk by just right? :-)', '2009-07-17 21:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578006, 806177, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the shadows to add interest. I like the composition, with the girls leaving the scene at the corner. With the shadows, and the clean, simple scene, it works quite well. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice use of the shadows to add interest. I like the composition, with the girls leaving the scene at the corner. With the shadows, and the clean, simple scene, it works quite well. Nice job.', '2009-07-17 21:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578017, 807415, 19831, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m not sure how this will fare with voters overall, but I quite like it. I mean, the blur is perfect here. You can obviously tell what it is, but the blur gives this great sense of motion, of the fast city night pace, you know. Good comp, simple, yet to the point. Well done for me.</td>', 'Well, I''m not sure how this will fare with voters overall, but I quite like it. I mean, the blur is perfect here. You can obviously tell what it is, but the blur gives this great sense of motion, of the fast city night pace, you know. Good comp, simple, yet to the point. Well done for me.', '2009-07-17 21:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578020, 806727, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great subject, very interesting. Executed very well too, nice exposure, good composition, good focus, which seems to be rare for this challenge :-) I like it, nicely done!</td>', 'Great subject, very interesting. Executed very well too, nice exposure, good composition, good focus, which seems to be rare for this challenge :-) I like it, nicely done!', '2009-07-17 21:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578026, 806914, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great eye here! A daring shot, not sure how voters overall will score it, but I find it quite interesting, and I like it. The people there make it for me, not just any people, but these specific 2. THere is quite the dynamics going on with them. Their age, and the red clothing tie them together, yet their position, body placement etc, create a pulling apart tension. Pretty cool, nicely done.</td>', 'Great eye here! A daring shot, not sure how voters overall will score it, but I find it quite interesting, and I like it. The people there make it for me, not just any people, but these specific 2. THere is quite the dynamics going on with them. Their age, and the red clothing tie them together, yet their position, body placement etc, create a pulling apart tension. Pretty cool, nicely done.', '2009-07-17 21:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578028, 806624, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice use of framing on this shot. good job</td>', 'Nice use of framing on this shot. good job', '2009-07-17 21:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578033, 807402, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The tightness of the crowd gives this an almost abstract feel. It''s like one of those drawings where when you stare at it just right, you see a ship, or bird or something. I stare at this and start expecting to see some shapes there. Cool pic!</td>', 'Interesting shot. The tightness of the crowd gives this an almost abstract feel. It''s like one of those drawings where when you stare at it just right, you see a ship, or bird or something. I stare at this and start expecting to see some shapes there. Cool pic!', '2009-07-17 21:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578183, 806509, 47470, '<td valign="top">Perfect placement of the passerby!  The colors are nice and bright, but not over-saturated.  My pick for a ribbon.</td>', 'Perfect placement of the passerby!  The colors are nice and bright, but not over-saturated.  My pick for a ribbon.', '2009-07-18 02:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578187, 807145, 47470, '<td valign="top">(Not voting, just commenting.)<br/> <br/>Why post a picture of someone who obviously doesn''t want their picture taken?  I''m sure you had plenty of other photos you could have chosen from.  We photographers get the rap of being very invasive and I think this is a perfect example of that.  As a photographer who doesn''t like her picture taken, I completely understand reluctant subjects, and I try to respect that.  I''m just wondering why you chose to enter this.  Will your personal gain really outweigh what the subject would feel if she found this photo posted on the internet?</td>', '(Not voting, just commenting.) Why post a picture of someone who obviously doesn''t want their picture taken?  I''m sure you had plenty of other photos you could have chosen from.  We photographers get the rap of being very invasive and I think this is a perfect example of that.  As a photographer who doesn''t like her picture taken, I completely understand reluctant subjects, and I try to respect that.  I''m just wondering why you chose to enter this.  Will your personal gain really outweigh what the subject would feel if she found this photo posted on the internet?', '2009-07-18 03:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578208, 807006, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great action capture. The flames look so intense.</td>', 'Great action capture. The flames look so intense.', '2009-07-18 03:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578209, 807406, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot. Would have liked it cropped a little more at the top.</td>', 'Nice night shot. Would have liked it cropped a little more at the top.', '2009-07-18 04:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578211, 807011, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great clarity in the subject and good use of DOF.</td>', 'Great clarity in the subject and good use of DOF.', '2009-07-18 04:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578212, 806737, 94235, '<td valign="top">The DOF, subject clarity and the detail in the wisp of hair make this an interesting photo for the viewer. Would have liked to see the color boosted slightly but a satisfying shot all the same.</td>', 'The DOF, subject clarity and the detail in the wisp of hair make this an interesting photo for the viewer. Would have liked to see the color boosted slightly but a satisfying shot all the same.', '2009-07-18 04:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578214, 807297, 94235, '<td valign="top">The expression says it all. Wonderful capture!</td>', 'The expression says it all. Wonderful capture!', '2009-07-18 04:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578216, 807433, 94235, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly over saturated for me but a nice capture all the same.</td>', 'Looks slightly over saturated for me but a nice capture all the same.', '2009-07-18 04:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
