(5578502, 807024, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but it really needs focusing, less noise it would seem and some work on lighting..especially working on the colour in any processing program</td>', 'Nice concept but it really needs focusing, less noise it would seem and some work on lighting..especially working on the colour in any processing program', '2009-07-18 14:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578504, 807296, 86218, '<td valign="top">I dont know what to focus on here. Nothing draws my attention and currently just a jamble of metal and building. Focusing needs to be sharper and light to be worked on.</td>', 'I dont know what to focus on here. Nothing draws my attention and currently just a jamble of metal and building. Focusing needs to be sharper and light to be worked on.', '2009-07-18 14:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578506, 806566, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very nice unusual shot . I just feel the poor donkeys cut at the wrong place for this the work very good..to close to the eyes. The blown background also disturbing/draws eyes away from the scene.</td>', 'Very nice unusual shot . I just feel the poor donkeys cut at the wrong place for this the work very good..to close to the eyes. The blown background also disturbing/draws eyes away from the scene.', '2009-07-18 14:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578566, 806565, 93756, '<td valign="top">Original! These window panes were a great find.</td>', 'Original! These window panes were a great find.', '2009-07-18 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578727, 807301, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good motion capture. Well done.</td>', 'Good motion capture. Well done.', '2009-07-18 23:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578729, 807189, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well captured. May have increased the brightness and color levels to give a little more impact.</td>', 'Well captured. May have increased the brightness and color levels to give a little more impact.', '2009-07-18 23:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578731, 806357, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice motion blur and a great title to match.</td>', 'Nice motion blur and a great title to match.', '2009-07-18 23:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578732, 806937, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great setting and a lovely capture.</td>', 'Great setting and a lovely capture.', '2009-07-18 23:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578735, 805867, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good capture and the tones convey the mood of the setting. Well done.</td>', 'Good capture and the tones convey the mood of the setting. Well done.', '2009-07-18 23:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578737, 806930, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great capture although I may have framed it a little closer to exclude so much of the dark foreground.</td>', 'Great capture although I may have framed it a little closer to exclude so much of the dark foreground.', '2009-07-18 23:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578751, 806565, 108036, '<td valign="top">Really stunning.  At first impression, I thought this violated the basic editing rules...  but I can see how a tallented photographer could pull it off.  Each window is just beautiful, and together they tell a whole story.  Good job!</td>', 'Really stunning.  At first impression, I thought this violated the basic editing rules...  but I can see how a tallented photographer could pull it off.  Each window is just beautiful, and together they tell a whole story.  Good job!', '2009-07-18 23:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578762, 805524, 108036, '<td valign="top">Something about this stands out among most of the others...  maybe the beautiful little girl... maybe the old man... maybe "SEMNIFICATIA VISELOR", whatever that means...  I''m not sure.  But I really like it!</td>', 'Something about this stands out among most of the others...  maybe the beautiful little girl... maybe the old man... maybe "SEMNIFICATIA VISELOR", whatever that means...  I''m not sure.  But I really like it!', '2009-07-18 23:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578776, 806044, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot.  Colors are great, the fun the kids are having is well captured, even in the reflection.  I''m thinking Chicago for some reason.</td>', 'This is an awesome shot.  Colors are great, the fun the kids are having is well captured, even in the reflection.  I''m thinking Chicago for some reason.', '2009-07-19 00:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578778, 806976, 103032, '<td valign="top">The shop keepers red smock and yellow bucket (against the dark backdrop) and his stance make this a good color SP pic.</td>', 'The shop keepers red smock and yellow bucket (against the dark backdrop) and his stance make this a good color SP pic.', '2009-07-19 00:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578779, 807006, 103032, '<td valign="top">Right place, right time (for you; not the truck owner).  Wow, those flames and black smoke tell it all.</td>', 'Right place, right time (for you; not the truck owner).  Wow, those flames and black smoke tell it all.', '2009-07-19 00:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578780, 806624, 103032, '<td valign="top">She looks like she''s having a good time.  I like how you were able to frame her in the red structure, and having the blue background to contrast.  She is definitely the focal point.  Nice job.</td>', 'She looks like she''s having a good time.  I like how you were able to frame her in the red structure, and having the blue background to contrast.  She is definitely the focal point.  Nice job.', '2009-07-19 00:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578781, 805926, 103032, '<td valign="top">You don''t see that every day, at least not in the lower 48.  Has to be Alaska or Canada.  My only critique would be not crop so tight to give the picture greater context (building in the background and such).  I know it''s obviously a highway with the asphalt and lane dividers... but then again, if this is a "common" sight on a desolate highway, then the tight crop does portray the illusion that it''s very unusual.  Anyways, nice pic.</td>', 'You don''t see that every day, at least not in the lower 48.  Has to be Alaska or Canada.  My only critique would be not crop so tight to give the picture greater context (building in the background and such).  I know it''s obviously a highway with the asphalt and lane dividers... but then again, if this is a "common" sight on a desolate highway, then the tight crop does portray the illusion that it''s very unusual.  Anyways, nice pic.', '2009-07-19 00:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578783, 806727, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice, one of the more interesting photos so far.  I''m betting you''ll have one in the pigeons challenge, if not, this would have been great in it.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice, one of the more interesting photos so far.  I''m betting you''ll have one in the pigeons challenge, if not, this would have been great in it.  Well done.', '2009-07-19 00:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578786, 807213, 103032, '<td valign="top">Hmm, she''s not happy.  When mom''s not happy, nobody''s happy.  Good luck to him.  Good pic from you.</td>', 'Hmm, she''s not happy.  When mom''s not happy, nobody''s happy.  Good luck to him.  Good pic from you.', '2009-07-19 00:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578793, 806357, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve got the blur showing him scattering the pigeons.  His red shirt makes him standout among the neutral tones.</td>', 'I like how you''ve got the blur showing him scattering the pigeons.  His red shirt makes him standout among the neutral tones.', '2009-07-19 01:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578801, 807145, 103032, '<td valign="top">Bad day, I think she''s trying to find her lost kid <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=803589" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">linky</a>.  Good capture of communication.</td>', 'Bad day, I think she''s trying to find her lost kid linky.  Good capture of communication.', '2009-07-19 01:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578803, 806988, 103032, '<td valign="top">Good street pic, but on the tech side, it''s a bit hazy.  Maybe bump up the contrast.</td>', 'Good street pic, but on the tech side, it''s a bit hazy.  Maybe bump up the contrast.', '2009-07-19 01:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578806, 806177, 103032, '<td valign="top">Like it, nice moment between mother and daughter.  Like the texture of the cobble stones and the shadows going over them.  Composition is balanced to me.</td>', 'Like it, nice moment between mother and daughter.  Like the texture of the cobble stones and the shadows going over them.  Composition is balanced to me.', '2009-07-19 01:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578809, 807440, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is a cool pic.  That yellow line acts like a barrier between him staying wet and getting out of the rain.  The yellow pulls this pic together.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a cool pic.  That yellow line acts like a barrier between him staying wet and getting out of the rain.  The yellow pulls this pic together.  Well done.', '2009-07-19 01:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578811, 806780, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good.  Looks like the guy in the black t-shirt is interested.  Well done capture of the context in the reflection.</td>', 'This is pretty good.  Looks like the guy in the black t-shirt is interested.  Well done capture of the context in the reflection.', '2009-07-19 01:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578819, 807442, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice LB shot.  Looks like all the old guys are enjoying the old car (show/parade?).</td>', 'Nice LB shot.  Looks like all the old guys are enjoying the old car (show/parade?).', '2009-07-19 01:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578848, 807341, 108697, '<td valign="top">lovely depth,textures and patterns. people in cafe on right give a sense of life. liked the clouds and how they add to sense of depth. thought that clipping the tip of the roof of second house on right a bit distracting. personally would have preferred pic without man walking towards camera</td>', 'lovely depth,textures and patterns. people in cafe on right give a sense of life. liked the clouds and how they add to sense of depth. thought that clipping the tip of the roof of second house on right a bit distracting. personally would have preferred pic without man walking towards camera', '2009-07-19 03:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578850, 807423, 108697, '<td valign="top">supurb. contrast between blurred images and focus fore and background breathtaking. the sky might have been  a bit more colourful or contrasted but  maybe not possible.</td>', 'supurb. contrast between blurred images and focus fore and background breathtaking. the sky might have been  a bit more colourful or contrasted but  maybe not possible.', '2009-07-19 03:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578856, 807294, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lots of things happening and people interacting. Nice shot. Girl in left is cut off wrong. Never cut person off at joints or with just bit of left foot toes off. Also the girl in pink dress is breaking the interaction between the woman and boy in background.</td>', 'Lots of things happening and people interacting. Nice shot. Girl in left is cut off wrong. Never cut person off at joints or with just bit of left foot toes off. Also the girl in pink dress is breaking the interaction between the woman and boy in background.', '2009-07-19 05:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578858, 807040, 86218, '<td valign="top">Pity you should think like this. Now you are penalizing those who vote with discretion. I understand how you might feel as Im new here and have been on the recieveing end myself. I have however resloved myself to take things I want to take of and try and be creative in my own sphere. Dont let voters cramp your style. 6 since exposure and comp works well for me but lacks interest and creativity.</td>', 'Pity you should think like this. Now you are penalizing those who vote with discretion. I understand how you might feel as Im new here and have been on the recieveing end myself. I have however resloved myself to take things I want to take of and try and be creative in my own sphere. Dont let voters cramp your style. 6 since exposure and comp works well for me but lacks interest and creativity.', '2009-07-19 05:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578859, 807429, 86218, '<td valign="top">Guy should be looking at you or to his left. Would like to have seen more of the bike as well.</td>', 'Guy should be looking at you or to his left. Would like to have seen more of the bike as well.', '2009-07-19 05:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578860, 805926, 86218, '<td valign="top">Work the colours here and the bear will pop out a bit more. Pity he is not as sharp as he could be</td>', 'Work the colours here and the bear will pop out a bit more. Pity he is not as sharp as he could be', '2009-07-19 05:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578865, 806146, 99263, '<td valign="top">This is just so funny. Great capture and great title too.</td>', 'This is just so funny. Great capture and great title too.', '2009-07-19 05:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578866, 805520, 99263, '<td valign="top">Should this not have been in the "FLOWERS" challenge?</td>', 'Should this not have been in the "FLOWERS" challenge?', '2009-07-19 05:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578869, 807040, 99263, '<td valign="top">This is street photography in the true sense. 5<br/> <br/>Ratings out of 5:<br/>Composition: 1<br/>Quality(focus,tones.lighting ect): 2<br/>Content and relevance: 2</td>', 'This is street photography in the true sense. 5 Ratings out of 5:Composition: 1Quality(focus,tones.lighting ect): 2Content and relevance: 2', '2009-07-19 05:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578880, 807301, 31637, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, the blur just adds to the atmosphere, feeling like a memory</td>', 'I like this shot, the blur just adds to the atmosphere, feeling like a memory', '2009-07-19 07:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578881, 807415, 31637, '<td valign="top">Maybe too much blur</td>', 'Maybe too much blur', '2009-07-19 07:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5578908, 806979, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting and exposure. Well captured.</td>', 'Good use of lighting and exposure. Well captured.', '2009-07-19 08:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579046, 806976, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well framed and positioned. I like the way only the highlights of the reflection show up in the door.</td>', 'Well framed and positioned. I like the way only the highlights of the reflection show up in the door.', '2009-07-19 09:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579047, 807170, 94235, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of tilted shots but I do think it adds to this shot. Well done!</td>', 'Not a big fan of tilted shots but I do think it adds to this shot. Well done!', '2009-07-19 09:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579048, 806565, 94235, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture, good clarity and perfectly framed. Great job!</td>', 'Interesting capture, good clarity and perfectly framed. Great job!', '2009-07-19 09:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579049, 807438, 94235, '<td valign="top">What a capture! The prudes will probably vote this low but it''s a gem IMO. Well done.</td>', 'What a capture! The prudes will probably vote this low but it''s a gem IMO. Well done.', '2009-07-19 09:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579050, 807382, 94235, '<td valign="top">The three very different expressions on the girls'' faces make this shot a high scorer for me. Great job!</td>', 'The three very different expressions on the girls'' faces make this shot a high scorer for me. Great job!', '2009-07-19 09:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579086, 806976, 76335, '<td valign="top">Those clean lines, the dramatic lighting, the border... it must be nixter! Great work here...</td>', 'Those clean lines, the dramatic lighting, the border... it must be nixter! Great work here...', '2009-07-19 11:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579090, 807442, 76335, '<td valign="top">Bumping this a couple points. The LB doesn''t do a whole lot for the image, but I wouldn''t say it takes anything away either. Of course, I may feel differently if I saw it without the effect. For me the juxtaposition of the man with his legs crossed against the oncoming (?) car really works for some reason. The shades of gold and yellow pull it all together. Nice!</td>', 'Bumping this a couple points. The LB doesn''t do a whole lot for the image, but I wouldn''t say it takes anything away either. Of course, I may feel differently if I saw it without the effect. For me the juxtaposition of the man with his legs crossed against the oncoming (?) car really works for some reason. The shades of gold and yellow pull it all together. Nice!', '2009-07-19 11:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579093, 807150, 76335, '<td valign="top">Yes. Had to be in color. Great joy in this one.</td>', 'Yes. Had to be in color. Great joy in this one.', '2009-07-19 11:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579094, 807230, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great story here and a good candid moment.</td>', 'Great story here and a good candid moment.', '2009-07-19 11:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579097, 807453, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great candid, lots of fun. Really works in color.</td>', 'Great candid, lots of fun. Really works in color.', '2009-07-19 11:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579100, 806921, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice moody feel to this.</td>', 'Nice moody feel to this.', '2009-07-19 11:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579102, 806059, 76335, '<td valign="top">I don''t know Portuguese, but I''m guessing she has an agenda. Good photojournalism.</td>', 'I don''t know Portuguese, but I''m guessing she has an agenda. Good photojournalism.', '2009-07-19 11:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579125, 807159, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks she''s her own bus. Great find.</td>', 'Looks she''s her own bus. Great find.', '2009-07-19 12:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579127, 805708, 76335, '<td valign="top">Bumping this a point or so. I''ll call it a street portrait -- hard to tell if it''s candid or not. Doesn''t matter much. Technicalities and categories and challenges aside, it''s a great image -- almost a character study. The color, I think, is necessary to tell the story. The natural framing and low angle are very effective. Good job!</td>', 'Bumping this a point or so. I''ll call it a street portrait -- hard to tell if it''s candid or not. Doesn''t matter much. Technicalities and categories and challenges aside, it''s a great image -- almost a character study. The color, I think, is necessary to tell the story. The natural framing and low angle are very effective. Good job!', '2009-07-19 12:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579131, 807399, 76335, '<td valign="top">I wish the one manneuqin''s head wasn''t cropped off (even if she doesn''t really have one, it would be good to see that just so the viewer can instantly resolve it). Also, I wish the passerby''s face were a bit more visible. Some will consider this a cliche, but I think it''s closer to street photography than many of the shots I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'I wish the one manneuqin''s head wasn''t cropped off (even if she doesn''t really have one, it would be good to see that just so the viewer can instantly resolve it). Also, I wish the passerby''s face were a bit more visible. Some will consider this a cliche, but I think it''s closer to street photography than many of the shots I''ve seen so far.', '2009-07-19 12:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579132, 806939, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Disorienting geometry is an easy sell to me. That said, I have to wonder if this would be more effective in black and white. Just a thought.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Disorienting geometry is an easy sell to me. That said, I have to wonder if this would be more effective in black and white. Just a thought.', '2009-07-19 12:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579136, 807058, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is really good. I think shooting from you car window might be cheating(!), but I like that you''ve incorporated that into the image in an interesting way. I kind of wish we were a little bit closer, as they''re does seem to be some interesting and bizarre things happening there.</td>', 'This is really good. I think shooting from you car window might be cheating(!), but I like that you''ve incorporated that into the image in an interesting way. I kind of wish we were a little bit closer, as they''re does seem to be some interesting and bizarre things happening there.', '2009-07-19 12:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579140, 807124, 49773, '<td valign="top">This whole cluster intrigues me really much. The pink chair, the white sox, the alluminium accordion, all those wheels.</td>', 'This whole cluster intrigues me really much. The pink chair, the white sox, the alluminium accordion, all those wheels.', '2009-07-19 12:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579142, 807199, 49773, '<td valign="top">Looks like a funeral litany.</td>', 'Looks like a funeral litany.', '2009-07-19 12:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579181, 806727, 86218, '<td valign="top">A shot with so much potential but you need a cleaner background. Trees are fine but the black pole running through his arm breaks this a bit. Colours vibrant and emotions in the shot. Longer lens, less depth would help here as well. I like. 6</td>', 'A shot with so much potential but you need a cleaner background. Trees are fine but the black pole running through his arm breaks this a bit. Colours vibrant and emotions in the shot. Longer lens, less depth would help here as well. I like. 6', '2009-07-19 13:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579230, 807417, 39547, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!</td>', 'I love this photo!', '2009-07-19 15:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579250, 805867, 41357, '<td valign="top">looks a little like the place they made the movie hostel<br/>(if you ever find that hostel don''t forget to page me) -8</td>', 'looks a little like the place they made the movie hostel(if you ever find that hostel don''t forget to page me) -8', '2009-07-19 15:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579468, 806059, 84765, '<td valign="top">I am sure this picture makes more sense if you understand what the sign says, but I don''t read Spanish (or whatever it is). Therefore only 2 from me.</td>', 'I am sure this picture makes more sense if you understand what the sign says, but I don''t read Spanish (or whatever it is). Therefore only 2 from me.', '2009-07-19 20:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579485, 806609, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good color and lighting under difficult shooting conditions. Nice job.</td>', 'Good color and lighting under difficult shooting conditions. Nice job.', '2009-07-19 20:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579488, 807295, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good use of low angle puts a nice framing effect around the subject. Well lit and well done!</td>', 'Good use of low angle puts a nice framing effect around the subject. Well lit and well done!', '2009-07-19 20:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579491, 807177, 94235, '<td valign="top">Looks like the Victoria markets in Melbourne. The place takes on a completely different appearance without the crowds of people everywhere. Well captured</td>', 'Looks like the Victoria markets in Melbourne. The place takes on a completely different appearance without the crowds of people everywhere. Well captured', '2009-07-19 20:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579493, 806178, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well lit and captured. Only nit-pick is I would have liked to see all of his right hand.</td>', 'Well lit and captured. Only nit-pick is I would have liked to see all of his right hand.', '2009-07-19 20:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579495, 807234, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good title for a well captured image.</td>', 'Good title for a well captured image.', '2009-07-19 20:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579497, 806914, 94235, '<td valign="top">Speaks volumes! Well framed and captured.</td>', 'Speaks volumes! Well framed and captured.', '2009-07-19 20:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579499, 807060, 94235, '<td valign="top">Colorful stall. He should be busier with all that lovely selection to choose from.</td>', 'Colorful stall. He should be busier with all that lovely selection to choose from.', '2009-07-19 20:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579501, 806780, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good perspective and a nicely captured image.</td>', 'Good perspective and a nicely captured image.', '2009-07-19 20:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579503, 806509, 94235, '<td valign="top">Colorful, well framed and great timing!</td>', 'Colorful, well framed and great timing!', '2009-07-19 21:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579506, 807126, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nicely finished with the red border!</td>', 'Nicely finished with the red border!', '2009-07-19 21:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579510, 807398, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good feeling of depth looking down the street. Nicely done.</td>', 'Good feeling of depth looking down the street. Nicely done.', '2009-07-19 21:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579513, 807341, 94235, '<td valign="top">May have boosted the color slightly but I like the finishing process used here.</td>', 'May have boosted the color slightly but I like the finishing process used here.', '2009-07-19 21:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579515, 806615, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice low angle gives it a real street feel.</td>', 'Nice low angle gives it a real street feel.', '2009-07-19 21:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579518, 807308, 94235, '<td valign="top">No people in the foreground gives this the feeling of being a huge market place. Well captured.</td>', 'No people in the foreground gives this the feeling of being a huge market place. Well captured.', '2009-07-19 21:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579519, 807435, 94235, '<td valign="top">Although a little dark I do like the low perspective of this shot.</td>', 'Although a little dark I do like the low perspective of this shot.', '2009-07-19 21:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
