(5581860, 806143, 35602, '<td valign="top">Looks like  a drug deal.  Just kidding.  Very interesting image.  Makes me feel sad, though I know they were just having fun.  The emotion I get is of being on the run orphans with nobody but themselves to take care of each other.  Wonderful emotion created with this seemingly simple image.</td>', 'Looks like  a drug deal.  Just kidding.  Very interesting image.  Makes me feel sad, though I know they were just having fun.  The emotion I get is of being on the run orphans with nobody but themselves to take care of each other.  Wonderful emotion created with this seemingly simple image.', '2009-07-21 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
