(5581984, 807029, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this, but it appears as just a photo of someone elses artwork on a wall.</td>', 'I like this, but it appears as just a photo of someone elses artwork on a wall.', '2009-07-21 20:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581987, 807367, 83313, '<td valign="top">The photo itself is pretty good, and an interesting slice of daily life. There is a major problem, however.<br/> <br/>There are an excessive amount of JPEG artifacts showing, most visible around the edges of the people. Your file size of only 39k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'The photo itself is pretty good, and an interesting slice of daily life. There is a major problem, however. There are an excessive amount of JPEG artifacts showing, most visible around the edges of the people. Your file size of only 39k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2009-07-21 20:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5581997, 806937, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like this and I am faving it, however, I am divided on whether or not this is street photography. I usually consider the genre to be more about people than just a location on it''s own. I am also aware there is debate on that concept. I''m going to have to split the difference and give this a neutral vote of 5. Sorry. I expect this shot to do  well, though.</td>', 'I really like this and I am faving it, however, I am divided on whether or not this is street photography. I usually consider the genre to be more about people than just a location on it''s own. I am also aware there is debate on that concept. I''m going to have to split the difference and give this a neutral vote of 5. Sorry. I expect this shot to do  well, though.', '2009-07-21 21:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
