(5582009, 806146, 83313, '<td valign="top">The shot is great and the title is perfect! This has the feel of a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">BVY</a> shot. If this is not Brian''s entry, then please take that as a compliment.</td>', 'The shot is great and the title is perfect! This has the feel of a  BVY shot. If this is not Brian''s entry, then please take that as a compliment.', '2009-07-21 21:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
