(5582400, 806146, 67697, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t know anything about street photography because I don''t understand why this would score so low.  The man wanted some McD''s - what''s wrong with that?  :D  I thought this was hilarious and you did a great jop with capturing the moment.</td>', 'I guess I don''t know anything about street photography because I don''t understand why this would score so low.  The man wanted some McD''s - what''s wrong with that?  :D  I thought this was hilarious and you did a great jop with capturing the moment.', '2009-07-22 01:34:05.000000', NULL, 0),
