(5583729, 807410, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love that you mix things up. My own photography is still pretty much plain-old, normal stuff. But TS and others are giving me more of an appreciation of out-of-the-box photography. I''ve had fun experimenting more and enjoy many more photos than I used to.<br/> <br/>That being said, the wire is distracting :D</td>', 'I love that you mix things up. My own photography is still pretty much plain-old, normal stuff. But TS and others are giving me more of an appreciation of out-of-the-box photography. I''ve had fun experimenting more and enjoy many more photos than I used to. That being said, the wire is distracting :D', '2009-07-23 00:27:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5583732, 807230, 103142, '<td valign="top">This should have scored much higher! It''s probably because of the cutting off both the head and the feet. People can usually live with (and like) one, but not both. I still think it''s great! and what a wonderful title!</td>', 'This should have scored much higher! It''s probably because of the cutting off both the head and the feet. People can usually live with (and like) one, but not both. I still think it''s great! and what a wonderful title!', '2009-07-23 00:29:39.000000', NULL, 0),
