(6443873, 807295, 72318, '<td valign="top">So this is what "Horse Guard botherers" are doing... ;)<br/> <br/>Nice view on it, and like the way you used the surround to frame him with the wide angle - makes him look rather small although i know that is a very confined space...<br/> <br/>I walk past this place a lot during my working week and always get in tourists'' way as that is the only clear path through most of the time - especially on the pavement outside with the mounted guards... photography etiquette goes out the window when you need to get to a meeting!</td>', 'So this is what "Horse Guard botherers" are doing... ;) Nice view on it, and like the way you used the surround to frame him with the wide angle - makes him look rather small although i know that is a very confined space... I walk past this place a lot during my working week and always get in tourists'' way as that is the only clear path through most of the time - especially on the pavement outside with the mounted guards... photography etiquette goes out the window when you need to get to a meeting!', '2011-06-14 18:54:20.000000', NULL, 0);
